  "description": "FHIRBundleBuilder is a .NET library designed for creating HL7 FHIR-compliant bundles tailored to healthcare systems. It enables the assembly and management of modular resources such as Patient, Composition, Practitioner, and Medication, adhering to FHIR R4 standards. With a focus on scalability and extensibility, the library simplifies the creation of structured clinical documents and transaction bundles. Built to integrate seamlessly within the ABDM ecosystem, it ensures healthcare interoperability while safeguarding sensitive data.",
